## External dependencies

This plugin has no bundled third-party code. At runtime it relies on:

- **Omarchy shell / Quickshell APIs** (`qs.Commons`, `qs.Ui`, `Quickshell.Io`,
  `Quickshell.Wayland`) — provided by the user's existing Omarchy install.
- **Noto Naskh Arabic** font, for correct Arabic script shaping. Commonly
  installed on Arch via the `noto-fonts` package group. If absent, the
  overlay falls back to the system default font, which may not shape Arabic
  script as cleanly.

The bundled ayah text/translations in `ayahs.json` are Quranic scripture,
transcribed and paraphrased by the plugin author; they are not copyrighted
software and are not covered by this license's warranty disclaimer in the
same sense as code. Users are encouraged to verify wording against a trusted
mushaf or quran.com.
